                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "Names what is loaded and what deleting costs. Deleting never touches a card that has the rack loaded \u2014 the loaded chain is the card\u2019s own copy and keeps playing; it simply reads \u201cno rack\u201d the next time it is drawn. Frozen inherited copies in existing takes keep the dead rack\u2019s name: there, the name is provenance, not a live reference."
